#: freestringsunit.rs_resistance_oortmer_note_p5
msgid ""
"5.Standart deviation of database for typical resistance van Oortmerssen's method:\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+\n"
"|        Parameters           |      Limitations     |\n"
"|-----------------------------+----------------------|\n"
"| Length of water line,   Lwl |      8 ... 80 m      |\n"
"| Displacement,          Disp |      5 ... 3000 m3   |\n"
"| Length/Breadth,       Lwl/B |      3 ... 6.2       |\n"
"| Breadth/Draft,          B/T |    1.9 ... 4.0       |\n"
"| Prismatic coefficient,   Cp |   0.50 ... 0.73      |\n"
"| Midship coefficient,     Cm |   0.70 ... 0.97      |\n"
"| Long.center of buoyancy,LCB |  -7% L ... 2.8% L    |\n"
"| Half entrance angle,     ie |     10 ... 46 degr   |\n"
"| Speed/length,    V/sqrt(Lwl)|      0 ... 1.79      |\n"
"| Froude number,           Fr |      0 ... 0.50      |\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+"
msgstr ""
"5. Écart type de la base de données pour la résistance typique selon la méthode de van Oortmerssen :\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+\n"
"|         Paramètres          |     Limitations      |\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+\n"
"| Longueur à la flottaison, Lwl |     8 ... 80 m      |\n"
"| Déplacement,              Disp |     5 ... 3000 m3   |\n"
"| Longueur/Largeur,       Lwl/B |     3 ... 6.2       |\n"
"| Largeur/Tirant d'eau,     B/T |   1.9 ... 4.0       |\n"
"| Coefficient prismatique,   Cp |   0.50 ... 0.73      |\n"
"| Coefficient de maître-couple, Cm | 0.70 ... 0.97    |\n"
"| Centre longitudinal de carène, LCB | -7% L ... 2.8% L |\n"
"| Demi-angle d'entrée,       ie |    10 ... 46 degr   |\n"
"| Vitesse/longueur, V/sqrt(Lwl) |     0 ... 1.79      |\n"
"| Nombre de Froude,          Fr |     0 ... 0.50      |\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+"

