#. 长篇技术说明按原文行序逐行交由 DeepSeek Flash 翻译，保留换行；专业含义与定宽表格排版仍需复核。
#: freestringsunit.rs_propeller_task5_note
msgctxt "freestringsunit.rs_propeller_task5_note"
msgid ""
"1.1   This program calculates the open water characteristics of a fixed-pitch full-scale\n"
"propeller,as published by:\n"
"*     M.W.C.Oosterveld and P. van Oossanen. Further Computer-Analyzed Data of Wageningen\n"
"B-Screw Series. I.S.P., Vol. 22, No. 251, July 1975.\n"
"N.M.S.B., Report No. 479.\n"
"1.2   Also the program calculates for each RPM the coefficients of a third degree  poly-\n"
"nomial, expressed in the speed ratio J.\n"
"1.3   When decreasing the thrust and the  efficiency  by  approximately  3  percent, the\n"
"results can be used for a controllable pitch propeller without a nozzle.\n"
"1.4   This is program modification calculates zero thrust and torque advances,\n"
"optimal advance Jopt and maximal efficiency Eta0_max of propeller series B.\n"
"1.5   The characteristics of a propeller series B set are as follows:\n"
"1.5.1    3 <= Nblade <= 7;  0,3 <=  Ae/Ao <= 1,05;  0,5 <=  P/Dp  <= 1,40 ;\n"
"1.6   The advance coefficient is as follow: 0 <=  Jp=Vp/n/Dp <= 1,6.\n"
"1.7   Main parameters of fixed pitch propellers of T,M,Z,ZM series:\n"
"+---------------------------------------+---+--------------+---------+\n"
"|            S E R I E S                | Z |     Ae/Ao    |   P/D   |\n"
"|---------------------------------------+---+--------------+---------|\n"
"| I.Titov          T-4-35 T-4-58 T-4-75 | 4 |0.35 0.58 0.75|0.70-1.50|\n"
"| V.Mishkevich     M-4-65 M-4-75 M-4-85 | 4 |0.65 0.75 0.85|0.60-1.40|\n"
"| M.Zavadovsky           Z-4-85 Z-4-100 | 4 |   0.85, 1.0  |0.90-1.40|\n"
"| KSRI-BIHS    ZM-5-70 ZM-5-85 ZM-5-100 | 5 |0.70 0.85 1.0 |0.80-1.35|\n"
"| V.Turbal                       T-6-68 | 6 |    0.680     |0.40-1.36|\n"
"| V.Turbal                       T-7-70 | 7 |    0.700     |0.50-1.30|\n"
"| V.Turbal                       T-8-72 | 8 |    0.720     |0.50-1.30|\n"
"+---------------------------------------+---+--------------+---------+"
msgstr ""
"1.1   Ce programme calcule les caractéristiques en eau libre d'une hélice à pas fixe à l'échelle réelle,\n"
"hélice, comme publié par :\n"
"*     M.W.C.Oosterveld and P. van Oossanen. Further Computer-Analyzed Data of Wageningen\n"
"B-Screw Series. I.S.P., Vol. 22, No. 251, July 1975.\n"
"N.M.S.B., Report No. 479.\n"
"1.2   De plus, le programme calcule pour chaque régime les coefficients d'un polynôme du troisième degré,\n"
"exprimé en fonction du rapport de vitesse J.\n"
"1.3   En réduisant la poussée et le rendement d'environ 3 pour cent,\n"
"les résultats peuvent être utilisés pour une hélice à pas variable sans tuyère.\n"
"1.4   Cette modification du programme calcule les avances à poussée nulle et à couple nul,\n"
"l'avance optimale Jopt et le rendement maximal Eta0_max des hélices de la série B.\n"
"1.5   Les caractéristiques d'un jeu d'hélices de la série B sont les suivantes :\n"
"1.5.1    3 <= Nblade <= 7;  0,3 <=  Ae/Ao <= 1,05;  0,5 <=  P/Dp  <= 1,40 ;\n"
"1.6   Le coefficient d'avance est le suivant : 0 <=  Jp=Vp/n/Dp <= 1,6.\n"
"1.7   Principaux paramètres des hélices à pas fixe des séries T, M, Z, ZM :\n"
"+---------------------------------------+---+--------------+---------+\n"
"|            S E R I E S                | Z |     Ae/Ao    |   P/D   |\n"
"|---------------------------------------+---+--------------+---------|\n"
"| I.Titov          T-4-35 T-4-58 T-4-75 | 4 |0.35 0.58 0.75|0.70-1.50|\n"
"| V.Mishkevich     M-4-65 M-4-75 M-4-85 | 4 |0.65 0.75 0.85|0.60-1.40|\n"
"| M.Zavadovsky           Z-4-85 Z-4-100 | 4 |   0.85, 1.0  |0.90-1.40|\n"
"| KSRI-BIHS    ZM-5-70 ZM-5-85 ZM-5-100 | 5 |0.70 0.85 1.0 |0.80-1.35|\n"
"| V.Turbal                       T-6-68 | 6 |    0.680     |0.40-1.36|\n"
"| V.Turbal                       T-7-70 | 7 |    0.700     |0.50-1.30|\n"
"| V.Turbal                       T-8-72 | 8 |    0.720     |0.50-1.30|\n"
"+---------------------------------------+---+--------------+---------+"

